<title>POLAND: KROSNO AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>KROSNO AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.49 vs   0.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.19 vs   0.56</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.15 vs   0.61</p>
<p> Sales		   14.36 vs  12.77</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.25 vs   5.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.68 vs   9.43</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.36 vs  11.54</p>
<p> Sales		  119.74 vs  97.27</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is</p>
<p>Krosnienskie Huty Szkla Krosno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
